; Used by scripts/bench.sh to measure runtime patchbay overhead with many
; rules. Only the last rule's filter matches "solo" (the bench subject), so
; the other 49 cost a `subject_mod.matches` call each per inbound PUB. The
; matching rule's gate is false on bench payloads, so we measure the
; per-rule scan + one full eval, not extra fan-out work.
